_A5 = [("Samantala umapela ang PhilHealth Insurance Corporation o PhilHealth sa mga pribadong ospital.", "Meanwhile, the PhilHealth Insurance Corporation appealed to the private hospitals."), ("Ito’y kaugnay ng pagbibigay ng benepisyo sa kanilang mga miyembro.", "This is in connection with giving benefits to their members."), ("Una nang sinabi ng Private Hospitals Association of the Philippines na posibleng hindi pagbigyan ang mga PhilHealth members dahil sa utang ng kumpanya.", "The Private Hospitals Association of the Philippines had earlier said that PhilHealth members might not be accommodated because of the company’s debt."), ("Matagal umanong naibibigay ng PhilHealth ang bayad nito sa mga private hospitals gayung naghuhulog naman ang mga miyembro nito.", "PhilHealth reportedly takes a long time to give its payment to the private hospitals even though its members do make their contributions."), ("Samantala, nangako naman ang PhilHealth na aayusin ang problema para sa pagbibigay ng mabuting serbisyo.", "Meanwhile, PhilHealth promised to fix the problem in order to give good service.")]
