_A6 = [("Halos nobenta porsyento na ng mga Pilipino ang miyembro na ng PhilHealth.", "Almost ninety percent of Filipinos are already members of PhilHealth."), ("Kabilang na rito ang nakatira sa malalayong probinsiya partikular sa Mindanao.", "Included in this are those who live in far provinces, particularly in Mindanao."), ("Ito na nga raw ang pinakamagandang Christmas gift na natanggap ng ahensiya.", "This is reportedly the best Christmas gift the agency has received."), ("Kamakailan lang, nakatanggap din ng seal of excellence ang Philhealth mula sa Civil Service Commission para sa kanilang pagtalima sa Republic Act bilang siyam na libo, apat na raan at walumpu’t lima o anti-red tape act.", "Just recently, Philhealth also received a seal of excellence from the Civil Service Commission for its compliance with Republic Act number 9485, or the anti-red tape act.")]
